description = "A beverage dispenser. It accepts coins."
mundane_solution = "Insert two credits. Press B4."
absurd_solution = "Breach the supply-chain firmware and issue a dispense command as root."
threat_assessment = "TARGET RUNS AN UNPATCHED EMBEDDED STACK BEHIND A CORPORATE VPN.
COUNTERMEASURES: 2 ACTIVE ICE PATROLS.
COLLATERAL RISK: MINIMAL.
NOTE: THE MACHINE IS UNLOCKED. THE COINS ARE IN YOUR POCKET."
